# Excalidraw monorepo

## Layout

- **`packages/excalidraw/`** — React library published as `@excalidraw/excalidraw`
- **`excalidraw-app/`** — Full web app (excalidraw.com) consuming the library
- **`packages/`** — `@excalidraw/common`, `@excalidraw/element`, `@excalidraw/math`, `@excalidraw/utils`
- **`examples/`** — Next.js and browser script examples

## Where to work

- Editor/library features → `packages/*`
- App-only behavior → `excalidraw-app/`

## Commands (Yarn 1 workspaces, repo root)

- `yarn test:typecheck` — TypeScript check
- `yarn test:update` — Tests (with snapshot updates); run before commits when tests change
- `yarn fix` — Format and lint auto-fix

## Stack notes

- Yarn workspaces; path aliases in `vitest.config.mts`
- Packages: esbuild; app: Vite
- TypeScript strict project-wide
